{"id":"4206fe2f14512ea48462c78379559c6a05aef28c","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"4206fe2f14512ea48462c78379559c6a05aef28c","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/auth-unknown-fields.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/config.reader\": patch","+\"pnpm\": patch","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+A key under a registry URL in the `_auth` setting that does not start with `@` is now skipped with a warning, so a field a later pnpm version adds there no longer breaks this one. A key that holds an `authToken` object but lacks its `@`, such as `org` for `@org`, is still an error."],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".changeset/switch-past-unreadable-config-v11.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/config.reader\": patch","+\"pnpm\": patch","+---","+","+pnpm now switches to the pnpm version a project pins even when it cannot read its configuration. Previously, a setting it rejected in the global config file, an `.npmrc` file, `_auth`, or `pnpm-workspace.yaml` stopped every command, `pnpm --version` included."],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".changeset/switch-past-unreadable-config.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+pnpm now switches to the pnpm version a project pins even when it cannot read its configuration. Previously, a setting it rejected in the global config file, an `.npmrc` file, or `_auth`, or a `pnpm-workspace.yaml` it could not parse, stopped every command, `pnpm --version` included."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pre_command.rs","lines":["@@ -70,6 +70,7 @@ use std::{","     slice,"," };"," use system_runtime_version::system_runtime_version;","+use unreadable_settings::switch_past_unreadable_settings;"," "," /// Run the pre-command checks and return the work they ask for, if any. The"," /// checks themselves report through `args.reporter` and fail the command by","@@ -113,7 +114,8 @@ fn pre_comm